            "content": "<p>Over 20 million tons of coconut shells are produced yearly, much of which goes unused. By turning coconut fiber into eco-friendly collar extenders, we reduce waste and reliance on synthetic materials, preventing<strong> 3,380 coconuts</strong> from ending up in landfills annually.<br/><br/></p>",
