            "content": "<p>Over 250,000 tons of eggshell waste are generated each year, most of it is discarded. We give this natural, calcium-rich material a second life by transforming 1,352 kg of eggshells (equivalent to <strong>22,533</strong> eggs) into durable collar extenders. Less waste, more impact.This sustainable innovation helps minimize the environmental impact, promotes circular design, and supports a cleaner, more conscious fashion industry. One collar at a time.<br/><br/></p>",
            "indent_heading": false
          }
        }
      },
